  "components": [
    {
      "name": "Primary Button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-primary",
      "description": "The one amber action on a view: Clone, New repository, Save changes.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-btn ds-btn-primary\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M128 24a104 104 0 1 0 104 104A104.11 104.11 0 0 0 128 24Zm45.66 109.66-40 40a8 8 0 0 1-11.32 0l-40-40a8 8 0 0 1 11.32-11.32L120 148.69V88a8 8 0 0 1 16 0v60.69l26.34-26.35a8 8 0 0 1 11.32 11.32Z\"/></svg>Clone</button>",
      "css": ".ds-btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;height:40px;padding:0 16px;border:0;border-radius:8px;font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:0.9375rem;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 150ms,color 150ms,translate 150ms}.ds-btn:active{translate:0 1px}.ds-btn:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--signal-line);outline-offset:2px}.ds-btn-primary{background:var(--signal);color:var(--signal-ink)}.ds-btn-primary:hover{background:var(--signal-hover)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Default Button (small)",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-default",
      "description": "Secondary actions in panes and toolbars: Check again, Tag, Deprecate.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-btn-default\">Check again</button>",
      "css": ".ds-btn-default{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;height:32px;padding:0 12px;border:0;border-radius:8px;background:var(--raised);color:var(--ink);font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:0.8125rem;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 150ms,translate 150ms}.ds-btn-default:hover{background:var(--pressed)}.ds-btn-default:active{translate:0 1px}.ds-btn-default:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--signal-line);outline-offset:2px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Ghost Button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-ghost",
      "description": "Low-stakes actions: Keep it, Select all, clearing a range.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-btn-ghost\">Keep it</button>",
      "css": ".ds-btn-ghost{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:40px;padding:0 16px;border:0;border-radius:8px;background:transparent;color:var(--ink-muted);font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:0.9375rem;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 150ms,color 150ms}.ds-btn-ghost:hover{background:var(--raised);color:var(--ink)}.ds-btn-ghost:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--signal-line);outline-offset:2px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Danger Ghost Button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-danger-ghost",
      "description": "Destructive actions outside a confirm dialog: Delete, Yank, Revoke.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-btn-danger-ghost\">Delete</button>",
      "css": ".ds-btn-danger-ghost{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:32px;padding:0 12px;border:0;border-radius:8px;background:transparent;color:var(--danger-text);font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:0.8125rem;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 150ms}.ds-btn-danger-ghost:hover{background:var(--danger-wash)}.ds-btn-danger-ghost:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--signal-line);outline-offset:2px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Query Input",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "input",
      "description": "Sunken 44px field with a hairline ring; mono variant for queries, URLs and keys.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-field\"><span class=\"ds-label\">Filter versions</span><input class=\"ds-input ds-input-code\" placeholder=\"source:web branch:main since:24h\"><span class=\"ds-hint\">Words match versions; - excludes.</span></label>",
      "css": ".ds-field{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;font-family:var(--font-sans)}.ds-label{font-size:0.8125rem;line-height:1.25rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink-muted)}.ds-hint{font-size:0.8125rem;line-height:1.25rem;color:var(--ink-faint)}.ds-input{height:44px;padding:0 14px;border:0;border-radius:8px;outline:none;background:var(--sunken);color:var(--ink);font:inherit;font-size:0.9375rem;box-shadow:0 0 0 1px var(--line-soft);transition:box-shadow 150ms,background-color 150ms}.ds-input::placeholder{color:var(--ink-faint)}.ds-input:hover{box-shadow:0 0 0 1px var(--line)}.ds-input:focus{background:var(--rail);box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--signal-line)}.ds-input-code{font-family:var(--font-mono);letter-spacing:0.02em}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Filter Chips",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "chip",
      "description": "Saved views and format filters; pressed turns amber.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-chips\"><button class=\"ds-chip\" aria-pressed=\"true\">Active</button><button class=\"ds-chip\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Last 24 hours</button><button class=\"ds-chip\" aria-pressed=\"false\">From main</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}.ds-chip{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:28px;padding:0 12px;border:0;border-radius:9999px;background:var(--raised);color:var(--ink-muted);font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:0.8125rem;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 150ms,color 150ms}.ds-chip:hover{background:var(--pressed);color:var(--ink)}.ds-chip[aria-pressed=\"true\"]{background:var(--signal);color:var(--signal-ink);font-weight:600}.ds-chip:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--signal-line);outline-offset:2px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Tags",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "chip-tag",
      "description": "20px non-interactive labels: visibility, role, format, status, short hashes.",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-tags\"><span class=\"ds-tag\">npm</span><span class=\"ds-tag\">Private</span><span class=\"ds-tag ds-mono\">33b0230</span></span>",
      "css": ".ds-tags{display:inline-flex;gap:8px}.ds-tag{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:20px;padding:0 8px;border-radius:9999px;background:var(--raised);color:var(--ink-muted);font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:0.6875rem}.ds-mono{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}"
    },
    {
      "name": "List Pane",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "list-row",
      "description": "The Pane List Rule: one pane, hairline rows, raised hover.",
      "html": "<ul class=\"ds-pane\"><li><a class=\"ds-row\" href=\"#\"><span class=\"ds-row-main\"><strong>@orbit/web</strong><span class=\"ds-row-meta\"><span class=\"ds-mono ds-ink\">2.4.676-main.33b0230</span> · 18.2K versions</span></span><span class=\"ds-row-time\">32m ago</span></a></li><li><a class=\"ds-row\" href=\"#\"><span class=\"ds-row-main\"><strong>@orbit/engine</strong><span class=\"ds-row-meta\"><span class=\"ds-mono ds-ink\">0.9.12</span> · 412 versions</span></span><span class=\"ds-row-time\">2h ago</span></a></li></ul>",
      "css": ".ds-pane{margin:0;padding:0;list-style:none;overflow:hidden;border-radius:12px;background:var(--pane);font-family:var(--font-sans)}.ds-pane>li+li{border-top:1px solid var(--line-soft)}.ds-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:12px 16px;color:var(--ink);text-decoration:none;transition:background-color 150ms}.ds-row:hover{background:var(--raised)}.ds-row:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--signal-line);outline-offset:-2px}.ds-row-main{flex:1;min-width:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column}.ds-row-main strong{font-weight:600;font-size:0.9375rem}.ds-row-meta{margin-top:2px;font-size:0.8125rem;color:var(--ink-muted)}.ds-ink{color:var(--ink)}.ds-mono{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-row-time{font-size:0.6875rem;color:var(--ink-faint)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Repository Tabs",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "tab",
      "description": "Underlined tab bar; the current tab is ink with an amber underline.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-tabs\"><a href=\"#\">Code</a><a href=\"#\">Commits</a><a href=\"#\">CI</a><a href=\"#\" aria-current=\"page\">Packages</a><a href=\"#\">Wiki</a><a href=\"#\">Knowledge</a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-tabs{display:flex;gap:20px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line-soft);font-family:var(--font-sans)}.ds-tabs a{margin-bottom:-1px;padding:0 4px 10px;border-bottom:2px solid transparent;color:var(--ink-muted);font-weight:600;font-size:0.9375rem;text-decoration:none;transition:color 150ms}.ds-tabs a:hover{color:var(--ink)}.ds-tabs a[aria-current=\"page\"]{color:var(--ink);border-bottom-color:var(--signal-line)}.ds-tabs a:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--signal-line);outline-offset:2px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Rail Place",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "nav-place",
      "description": "48px rail tile that tightens its radius and grows an amber pip when current.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-rail\"><a class=\"ds-place\" href=\"#\" aria-current=\"page\" aria-label=\"Home\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M224 115.55V208a16 16 0 0 1-16 16h-40a16 16 0 0 1-16-16v-40a8 8 0 0 0-8-8h-32a8 8 0 0 0-8 8v40a16 16 0 0 1-16 16H48a16 16 0 0 1-16-16v-92.45a16 16 0 0 1 5.17-11.78l80-75.48.11-.11a16 16 0 0 1 21.53 0 1.14 1.14 0 0 0 .11.11l80 75.48a16 16 0 0 1 5.08 11.78Z\"/></svg></a><a class=\"ds-place\" href=\"#\" aria-label=\"Access tokens\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"160\" cy=\"96\" r=\"56\"/><path d=\"M120 136 40 216M64 192l24 24\"/></svg></a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-rail{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:8px;width:72px;padding:12px 0;background:var(--rail)}.ds-place{position:relative;display:grid;place-items:center;width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:24px;background:var(--pane);color:var(--ink-muted);text-decoration:none;transition:border-radius 200ms,background-color 200ms,color 200ms}.ds-place:hover,.ds-place[aria-current=\"page\"]{border-radius:16px;background:var(--raised);color:var(--ink)}.ds-place::before{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:-12px;width:4px;height:36px;border-radius:0 9999px 9999px 0;background:var(--signal-line);scale:1 0.22;opacity:0;transition:scale 200ms,opacity 200ms}.ds-place:hover::before{scale:1 0.55;opacity:1}.ds-place[aria-current=\"page\"]::before{scale:1 1;opacity:1}.ds-place:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--signal-line);outline-offset:2px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Info Strip",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "strip",
      "description": "Amber-wash notice with a dot and an action: still importing, no runner.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-strip\"><span class=\"ds-strip-dot\"></span><span class=\"ds-strip-text\">Still importing. Large histories can take a minute.</span><button class=\"ds-strip-btn\">Check again</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-strip{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:8px 8px 8px 14px;border-radius:12px;background:var(--signal-wash);color:var(--ink);font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:0.9375rem}.ds-strip-dot{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--signal-line);flex:none}.ds-strip-text{flex:1;min-width:0}.ds-strip-btn{height:32px;padding:0 12px;border:0;border-radius:8px;background:var(--raised);color:var(--ink);font:inherit;font-size:0.8125rem;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer}.ds-strip-btn:hover{background:var(--pressed)}.ds-strip-btn:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--signal-line);outline-offset:2px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Facet Count Bars",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "facet",
      "description": "Signature query-console facet: rows with a raised bar scaled to the count; pressed turns amber wash.",
      "html": "<ul class=\"ds-facets\"><li><button class=\"ds-facet\" aria-pressed=\"true\"><span class=\"ds-facet-bar\" style=\"transform:scaleX(1)\"></span><span class=\"ds-facet-label\">Active</span><span class=\"ds-facet-count\">18.2K</span></button></li><li><button class=\"ds-facet\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"ds-facet-bar\" style=\"transform:scaleX(0.48)\"></span><span class=\"ds-facet-label\">Deleted</span><span class=\"ds-facet-count\">8,840</span></button></li><li><button class=\"ds-facet\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"ds-facet-bar\" style=\"transform:scaleX(0.03)\"></span><span class=\"ds-facet-label\">Yanked</span><span class=\"ds-facet-count\">452</span></button></li></ul>",
      "css": ".ds-facets{margin:0;padding:0;list-style:none;width:17rem;font-family:var(--font-sans)}.ds-facet{position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;width:100%;min-height:30px;padding:4px 8px;border:0;border-radius:6px;background:transparent;color:var(--ink);font:inherit;font-size:0.8125rem;text-align:left;cursor:pointer;overflow:hidden}.ds-facet:hover{background:var(--raised)}.ds-facet[aria-pressed=\"true\"]{font-weight:600}.ds-facet:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--signal-line);outline-offset:2px}.ds-facet-bar{position:absolute;inset:3px 0;transform-origin:left;border-radius:6px;background:var(--raised);opacity:0.7;transition:transform 300ms cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1)}.ds-facet[aria-pressed=\"true\"] .ds-facet-bar{background:var(--signal-wash);opacity:1}.ds-facet-label{position:relative;flex:1;min-width:0;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap}.ds-facet-count{position:relative;font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:0.75rem;color:var(--ink-muted);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Night Shift Console",
    "overview": "Gitmatrix is read by people checking on work their agents did while they weren't looking: what landed, what CI said, what a commit published, what the knowledge graph now believes. The system is a dark, warm, quiet console for that review. Charcoal panes with a faint warm cast (hue 70) sit on a slightly lighter page; text is warm off-white in three strengths; one amber signal marks what is selected, current or the next thing to press. Everything else stays neutral, so a person scanning a long table sees the amber and nothing competing with it.\n\nDensity is that of a working tool, not a marketing page. Lists are single panes with hairline-divided rows; numbers line up in tabular figures; versions, hashes, commands and counts are set in Geist Mono and words in Figtree. The densest surface (the package console: query bar, saved views, publish-rate strip, virtualized version table, facet column) and the sparsest (a sign-in persona grid) are built from the same handful of pieces. MatrixKit Neo is the incumbent system, vendored from Claude Design as is; Gitmatrix composes it with Tailwind utilities and adds almost no CSS of its own.\n\nDark is the home theme (`data-theme=\"dark\"` on `<html>`); a light theme redefines every token under `data-theme=\"light\"` and is chosen from the account menu. Both themes share the same roles, so code names roles, never values.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Warm charcoal tonal stack; depth by tone, not borders or shadows.",
      "One amber signal, for selection, current place and primary action only.",
      "Figtree for words, Geist Mono for machine strings, tabular numerals wherever numbers align.",
      "Panes of hairline-divided rows as the default container for anything listed.",
      "Shadows only on what floats: popups, toasts, dialogs, the bulk-selection bar.",
      "Tailwind utilities on the kit's role names; `mk-*` classes for kit components; CSS only where utilities can't reach.",
      "Phones lift every control to a 44px touch floor."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The One Amber Rule",
        "body": "Amber means selected, current, or the primary action on the screen. Nothing decorative is amber, no status is amber (success is green, failure is red, waiting is faint ink), and a screen has at most one filled amber button.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Roles-Not-Values Rule",
        "body": "Code names a role (`bg-pane`, `text-ink-faint`, `var(--signal-line)`), never an OKLCH literal and never a Tailwind palette color. The light theme only works because every surface is a role.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Chart-Hue Rule",
        "body": "Data hues (berry, and teal and violet when they're needed) appear only inside charts and their legend keys, with a hatch or shape so the meaning survives without color.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Mono-for-Machines Rule",
        "body": "If a machine wrote it or will parse it (a version, hash, command, URL, path, query, exit code, run number), it is Geist Mono. If a person reads it as language, it is Figtree.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Lined-Up Numbers Rule",
        "body": "Any number that sits in a column or updates in place uses tabular figures (`mk-tabular`, `tabular-nums`, or Geist Mono).",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Sentence-Case Rule",
        "body": "Headings, labels, column headers and buttons are sentence case. Nothing is set in uppercase with tracking.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Pane List Rule",
        "body": "Anything listed (repositories, commits, runs, files, packages, versions, published artifacts) is one `pane` with `rounded-pane`, rows divided by `line-soft` hairlines, and `raised` on row hover. Not a stack of separate cards.",
        "section": "layout"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Float-Only Shadow Rule",
        "body": "A shadow means \"this is above the page and will go away\". Cards, panes, tables and the rail never cast one.",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "**Do** use Tailwind utilities on the kit's role names (`bg-pane`, `text-ink-faint`, `rounded-pane`, `text-body-sm`) and the `mk-*` component classes; reach for CSS only where utilities can't (rendered Markdown in `.gm-prose`, scrollbar theming, the phone override that keeps tags at 20px), and put it in `app.css`.",
      "**Do** keep `matrixkit.css` and `tokens.css` vendored as is; adjust the kit from `app.css` or with utilities, which win because the kit is imported into the components layer.",
      "**Do** list things in a single pane with `line-soft` hairline rows, 12px by 16px row padding and a `raised` hover.",
      "**Do** reserve amber for the primary action, the current place and what is selected or brushed (The One Amber Rule).",
      "**Do** set versions, hashes, commands, URLs and counts in Geist Mono, and use tabular figures for every number that lines up.",
      "**Do** give every icon-only control a tooltip and an aria-label, and every input a visible label.",
      "**Do** teach in empty states: say what will appear here and show the exact command or config that makes it appear.",
      "**Do** keep controls at 44px on phones (the kit's phone rule) and re-flow wide tables into two-line rows under 768px rather than scrolling them sideways.",
      "**Do** check both themes; anything built from roles will already work."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "**Don't** use Tailwind's default palette or OKLCH literals in components; the default palette is deliberately reset away.",
      "**Don't** put borders or shadows on panes, cards or tables; separate them by tone and spacing.",
      "**Don't** put a shadow on anything that doesn't float (The Float-Only Shadow Rule).",
      "**Don't** use amber to mean warning or status; failure is red, success is green, waiting is faint ink.",
      "**Don't** use the data hues outside charts and their legend keys.",
      "**Don't** stack separate cards for list items, or nest a card inside a card.",
      "**Don't** set text in uppercase with letter-spacing, or add small labels above headings; headings stand on their own.",
      "**Don't** step off the type scale with Tailwind's stock sizes (`text-xs`, `text-sm`); use `text-micro`, `text-body-sm` and the rest."
    ]
  }
}
